\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li>终止与合流见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convergent}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Terminating}(A,\\to)\\land\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Convergent}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Terminating}(A,\\to)\\land\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处convergent采用TRS文献常用的“终止且合流”；对应本书complete/canonical/uniquely terminating，与第12章无限归约的强收敛不同。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terminating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer